  "bodyHash": "Wk+VnTm2vtA=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">此模組為Macaw's Bridges與Biomes O' Plenty之間增加了相容性。你是否曾夢想過用櫻桃木建造橋樑、屋頂或樓梯？感謝這個模組，現在這一切皆有可能！</span></p><p><em>我之前安裝了Macaw's Bridges/Fences/Roofs/Furnitures - BOP，擔心安裝這個模組後會刪除所有已放置的橋樑。</em></p><p>不用擔心，</p><p>Forge版本下，模組會自動轉換舊相容性中的所有舊方塊與物品。</p><p>Fabric版本則需使用一個模組，並配合預先填寫的設定檔來自動替換方塊。這些設定檔會像其他設定檔一樣在遊戲啟動時生成——更多詳情請見<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></p><p>NeoForge 1.20.6版本的轉換功能無法運作，這是NeoForge本身的問題。</p><p><strong>本模組支援：</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>- Macaw's Bridges</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/10/2025-02-06_21-46-35-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw's Roofs</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/12/2025-02-08_00-03-38-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw's Fences</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/17/2025-02-08_00-06-53-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw's Furnitures</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/11/2025-02-06_21-48-31-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw's Stairs</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/19/2025-02-08_00-21-41-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw's Doors</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/18/2025-02-08_00-13-34-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw's Trapdoors</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/20/368347203-e94d95f4-d581-47ac-99e9-f72083d106e3-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/13/2025-02-08_00-03-47-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw's Paths</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/33/2025-02-08_01-23-05-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw's Windows</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/14/2025-02-08_00-03-53-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/16/2025-02-08_00-04-04-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/15/2025-02-08_00-03-59-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>必要依賴：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong></p><p>適用於1.18.2以上版本的Terrablender（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a>）</p><p>適用於1.20.1以上版本的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a>（FORGE 或 FABRIC 或 NEOFORGE）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>可選依賴：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconfigurable-everything\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Everything</a></p>",
